actors.\n- The two-digit factors are 10, 25, and 50.\n- There are 3 two-digit factors.\n\nThus, the number of positive two-digit integers that are factors of both 100 and 150 is \\(\\boxed{3}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{3}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
